:1083},"end":{"line":26,"column":62,"offset":1133}}},{"type":"text","value":"，了解最新功能及改進","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":62,"offset":1133},"end":{"line":26,"column":72,"offset":1143}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":4,"offset":1075},"end":{"line":26,"column":72,"offset":1143}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1,"offset":1072},"end":{"line":26,"column":72,"offset":1143}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1,"offset":749},"end":{"line":26,"column":72,"offset":1143}}},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"特別鳴謝 Mohammed Zeeshan，感謝他為內容進行了初步工作，您可以在","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":3,"offset":1149},"end":{"line":28,"column":43,"offset":1189}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"https://github.com/alizeeshan1234/mollusk_testing","children":[{"type":"text","value":"此存儲庫","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":44,"offset":1190},"end":{"line":28,"column":48,"offset":1194}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":43,"offset":1189},"end":{"line":28,"column":100,"offset":1246}}},{"type":"text","value":"中找到相關內容","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":100,"offset":1246},"end":{"line":28,"column":107,"offset":1253}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":3,"offset":1149},"end":{"line":28,"column":107,"offset":1253}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1,"offset":1147},"end":{"line":28,"column":107,"offset":1253}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":28,"column":107,"offset":1253}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# 結論\r\n\r\n恭喜你！你已完成「使用 Mollusk 測試」課程。現在你已全面了解如何使用 Mollusk，一個為 Solana 程式提供快速執行、精確控制及詳細效能洞察的強大輕量級測試框架。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"你所學到的內容\" id=\"what-you-learned\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n在這個課程中，你已掌握以下重要知識：\r\n- Mollusk 如何利用低層 Solana 虛擬機（SVM）組件提供精簡的測試環境\r\n- Mollusk 輕量級方法相較於完整驗證器模擬的優勢\r\n- 使用核心 `mollusk-svm` crate 和程式特定的輔助工具設置 Mollusk\r\n- 使用 Mollusk 的四個主要執行 API 進行單一及鏈式指令測試\r\n- 實施全面的驗證檢查，包括成功條件、計算單元及帳戶狀態\r\n- 創建預初始化的代幣帳戶（Mints、Token Accounts、Associated Token Accounts）\r\n- 使用 `MolluskComputeUnitBencher` 基準測試計算單元消耗\r\n- 開發及測試自定義系統調用以實現專門功能\r\n- 通過計算預算、功能集及系統變量自定義執行環境\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"下一步\" id=\"next-steps\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n現在你已具備使用 Mollusk 構建穩健且經過良好測試的 Solana 程式的知識！以下是一些建議的下一步：\r\n1. 實踐於真實程式：運用你的 Mollusk 知識測試你的 [Anchor 程式](/zh-HK/courses/anchor-for-dummies/testing-your-program#mollusk-tests) 或 [Pinocchio 程式](/zh-HK/courses/introduction-to-pinocchio/testing-your-program#mollusk-tests)\r\n2. 探索挑戰：訪問 [挑戰部分](/zh-HK/challenges)，通過實踐練習應用你的 Mollusk 測試技能\r\n3. 加入社群：與其他使用 Mollusk 的開發者交流測試策略及最佳實踐，加入我們的 Discord\r\n4. 保持更新：關注 [Mollusk 儲存庫](https://github.com/anza-xyz/mollusk)，了解最新功能及改進\r\n\r\n> 特別鳴謝 Mohammed Zeeshan，感謝他為內容進行了初步工作，您可以在[此存儲庫](https://github.com/alizeeshan1234/mollusk_testing)中找到相關內容","highlightedCode":{}}